# The rows of src/runtime/Schedule.h and src/runtime/Schedule.cpp, a call each (src/tools/bench/bench.py).

## Schedule.cpp/a draw counted on the GPU, its depth kept
a schedule, ok true, 4 nodes
after them, node count: cooks false, runs true
after them, node crowd: cooks false, runs true
after them, node look: cooks true, runs true
after them, node seen: cooks false, runs true
node count: cooks false, runs true
node crowd: cooks false, runs true
node look: cooks false, runs true
node seen: cooks false, runs true
pass dispatch of 1 groups, reads 0, writes 0
pass dispatch of 1 groups, reads 0, writes 1
pass dispatch of 1 groups, reads 1, writes 1
pass draw of 3 vertices, instances counted on the GPU, into an image
port count.drawn: buffer written DrawCount, joined
port crowd.color: image written R8G8B8A8_UNORM, joined
port crowd.depth: image written DepthWrite, joined
port crowd.drawn: buffer read DrawCount, joined
port look.painted: image read Texture, joined
port look.texels: buffer written vec2
port seen.depth: image read Texture, joined
the device goes -> done
three frames -> done

